    <briefdescription>
<para>Get the boundary data for symmetric domain when the data is at C, E, or N-cell center.<linebreak/>
 <ref refid="interfacempp__domains__mod_1_1mpp__get__boundary" kindref="compound">mpp_get_boundary</ref> is used to get the boundary data for symmetric domain when the data is at C, E, or N-cell center. For cubic grid, the data should always at C-cell center. <linebreak/>
Example usage: </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>call mpp_get_boundary(domain, field, ebuffer, sbuffer, wbuffer, nbuffer) Get boundary information from domain and field and store in buffers </para>    </detaileddescription>
